			<div class="content" id="post-content-4844120">
									

<p>This is one of those weird &quot;I like it but&quot; things&#8230;.</p>
<p>1) Why is The Foundation the only one being affected? Why not members of other groups? Heck, why not other individuals? And does it apply to anyone attached to The Foundation, such as vendors, temp personnel, administrative staff? It just feels like it is being done to isolate The Foundation and that needs to be explained.</p>
<p>2) What happens to the rest of the world? Do birds freeze, or what about rivers and currents? Why do people not notice the missing day? And keep in mind that there are people giving birth, suffering from imminent death, and any number of other medical conditions. And I'm not even really getting into accidents or the possibility of the effects of sex or other issues.</p>
<p>It's a great idea but there are a lot of questions here.</p>

