					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jamaisj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6846344); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6846344&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608090185" alt="JamaisJ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6846344)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jamaisj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6846344); return false;" >JamaisJ</a></span> <span class="odate time_1608076488 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Dec 2020 23:54</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4845763">
									

<p>And&#8230;that didn't answer any questions, so putting it more bluntly:</p>
<p>1) This is a Keter-level event as it has the potential to see a lot of dead people, or at least inconvenienced ones. If fishermen are tracking a school of fish, this would put them a day behind, possibly causing them to miss a needed harvest. Unless doctors' idea of a great time is remaining on shift, you are going to see a lot of deaths as simple injuries become much more complicated due to the lack of immediate care; this even would encourage more bravery in individuals so you would see more accidents.</p>
<p>You would also see a lot of pregnancies result in deaths, as well as more mysterious pregnancies.</p>
<p>And if people are truly occupying their lives, expressing themselves fully, keep in mind that this frees all of those with murderous and other ill intents. If my idea of a tranquil day is one where I kill all of my enemies and rape their relatives, then just made that so much easier. And with all of the unprotected sex, you're going to see a huge spike in STDs.</p>
<p>In short, for most people it's going to be a day of picnics and rainbows, but for others it's going to be a day of blood and murder. There will be a lot of bodies.</p>
<p>2) The Foundation isn't going to be able to hide as many changes as you think. Not all clocks are hooked to the net, and you're ignoring a lot of obvious tells, such as weather patterns and animal movements.</p>
<p>3) You may be ignoring all of those other groups, but with The Foundation dealing with all of those bodies and other issues, this is going to leave them open to attacks on their sites. As such, you need to allow for that.</p>
<p>Straight up: This is an awesome horror event. Not so much a day of peace&#8230;.</p>

